            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Muse Spark 1.1 just launched and it's their most capable coding agent model yet.\n\nOn Terminal-Bench 2.1 it scores 80.0%, in the same cluster as Opus 4.8 (82.7%) and GPT 5.5 (83.4%).\n\nUse it in Cline with the Meta API! https://t.co/r29SAsFdMp"
