          "like_count": 31,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 3,
          "retweet_count": 3
        },
        "text": "Very cool demo of Muse Spark 1.1's agentic capabilities – shoutout @shuyanzh36.\n\nThis is the first model that really feels capable of personal superintelligence. See more in our blog post: https://t.co/ERnZfXrQSJ https://t.co/5lFxnRq4rC"
      },
