        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218936266998230",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Muse Spark 1.1 🥑 is out! with lot of improvements on agents / reasoning / coding. \n\nScaling RL has been tiring, rewarding, and full of lessons. \n\nTry it on https://t.co/pURegi9gvq and please send feedback + failure cases. They help make the model better.\n\nMore to come! https://t.co/yLkON6tDxH"
