        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218936266998230",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Muse Spark 1.1 is live in Julius for all users\n\nIn our testing, it stood out on creating visual artifacts using code, especially using html and react https://t.co/YPXNyrYO20 https://t.co/BSNqM5qP3n"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1318352046685290498",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T18:02:49.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075279523852263874"
        ],
