          "impression_count": 9236,
          "like_count": 47,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 7
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218936266998230",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Excited to share Muse Spark 1.1 -- built for real-world agentic and coding workflows, with strong tool use, computer use, and multimodal capabilities. \n\nProud of the team, and can't wait to see people put it to work to build, debug, and ship faster! https://t.co/gCNmVq2GgG"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "5721582",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T15:17:11.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075237837033889911"
        ],
