        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 4,
          "impression_count": 13303,
          "like_count": 28,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 3
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075224643829711101",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ohhh, hang on. A few things at once! \n\nFirst, the newly dropped Meta Muse spark 1.1 is.. their smallest model from MSL! \n\nSecond, it's natively multi-modal with video understanding and 1M tokens in context window!\n\nThird, they are opening up an API for it! \n\nIt's waitlisted but https://t.co/q4ZJ56sHxV https://t.co/QRSzoYDbsb"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1437102457822355458",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T14:55:47.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075228448159838226",
          "2075230237982699997",
