          "impression_count": 22610,
          "like_count": 148,
          "quote_count": 3,
          "reply_count": 14,
          "retweet_count": 19
        },
        "text": "AI developers - we’ve published a technical guide covering how to get started with Muse Spark on Meta Model API. Muse Spark is a multimodal reasoning model built for agentic tasks, coding, computer use and long-context workflows.\n\nSee what you can build 👉 https://t.co/d3raFYsyxp https://t.co/XkQqgGB9CF"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1495870534260690946",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T16:39:00.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075258430085054536"
