        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 64,
          "impression_count": 96424,
          "like_count": 383,
          "quote_count": 11,
          "reply_count": 18,
          "retweet_count": 33
        },
        "text": "Congrats to @elonmusk and @finkd / @alexandr_wang  on Grok 4.5 and Muse Spark 1.1 achieving SOTA on @harvey's LAB at significantly lower cost and latency. https://t.co/Pqt1BWIovq"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1270147489128017920",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T17:07:48.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075265676600860913"
        ],
        "id": "2075265676600860913",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 3,
          "impression_count": 15876,
          "like_count": 137,
          "quote_count": 1,
          "reply_count": 11,
          "retweet_count": 10
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218936266998230",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Been working on improving the real-world coding usefulness for muse spark 1.1\n\nThe model can autonomously solve many daily coding tasks, with much cheaper prices than competitors' models. Please try it on coding products and let us know if you have any feedback. https://t.co/PrIKMgCf8g"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1319101874532978690",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T17:05:45.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075265159430623334"
        ],
        "id": "2075265159430623334",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 19,
          "impression_count": 42997,
          "like_count": 225,
          "quote_count": 2,
          "reply_count": 12,
          "retweet_count": 15
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218444056707458",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "In addition to agents and coding, Muse Spark 1.1 is also really strong at answering health questions, a steadily growing use case for AI. On HealthBench-Pro, Muse Spark 1.1 achieves +5% better performance than Muse Spark 1.0 and beats all competitor models except Fable/Mythos. https://t.co/tx3suaTfTs https://t.co/sbuDTmPju7"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1214528593",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T16:22:43.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075254331620884853"
        ],
        "id": "2075254331620884853",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 4,
          "impression_count": 8068,
          "like_count": 88,
          "quote_count": 1,
          "reply_count": 7,
          "retweet_count": 6
        },
        "text": "It used to be that xAI and Meta were the outliers in terms of \"stronger on capabilities than safety.\"  \n\nMeta has done a lot to catch up on safety (well both actually) subsequently,* so now xAI stands ~alone on safety\n\nno company is perfect etc. but it's not a close comparison"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "969571031030616071",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T15:10:16.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075236097211121765"
        ],
        "id": "2075236097211121765",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 66,
          "impression_count": 743261,
          "like_count": 732,
          "quote_count": 19,
          "reply_count": 29,
          "retweet_count": 54
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075221792466092410",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "BREAKING: Meta $META has erased all of its losses and turned green on the day following the release of Muse Spark 1.1\n\nMark Zuckerberg notably broke a 3-year silence on X to announce the release. https://t.co/z7GPxGkSnG https://t.co/Y36xDygtdl"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1357426015312760834",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T16:46:10.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2075260234118115393"
        ],
        "id": "2075260234118115393",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 5,
          "impression_count": 17615,
          "like_count": 101,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 16,
          "retweet_count": 14
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2075218936266998230",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We’re releasing Muse Spark 1.1 today with a big step up in agentic capabilities. \n\nAlso releasing the API, and it is really, really cheap! I hope this opens up agentic intelligence to more people.\n\nThe rate at which intelligence is getting cheaper still feels underrated https://t.co/FlrwjoCYNH"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "14763",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T15:27:43.000Z",
