        "text": "We evaluated Muse Spark 1.1 from @AIatMeta Superintelligence Lab on Box’s Complex Work Eval.\n\nIt was competitive with top-tier models, especially on structured data analysis and report drafting.\n\nThe takeaway: models matter, but governed content is what makes enterprise AI useful https://t.co/My9fFenJ9d"
